concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-1-sec-301-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "301 7  Serious drugs—conditions for listing by regulation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-301-13 ;
    values:originalText "Before a regulation is made listing a substance or plant as a serious drug for the purposes of this Part, the Minister must be satisfied that:  (a) the substance or plant is likely to be taken without appropriate medical supervision; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167  Schedule 1  Serious drugs" ;
