concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-1-sec-10-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-10-2 ;
    values:originalText "(b) one or more of the following conditions is met:  (i) taking the substance or plant would create a risk of death or serious harm;  (ii) taking the substance or plant would have a physical or mental effect substantially similar to that caused by taking a serious drug that is already listed;  (iii) the substance or plant has the capacity to cause physiological dependence;  (iv) possession or conduct in relation to the substance or plant is proscribed under a law of a State, a Territory or a foreign country that has purposes similar to those of this Part;  (v) the substance or plant poses a substantial risk to the health or safety of the public." ;
    skos:definition "(b) one or more of the following conditions is met:  (i) taking the substance or plant would create a risk of death or serious harm;  (ii) taking the substance or plant would have a physical or mental effect substantially similar to that caused by taking a serious drug that is already listed;  (iii) the substance or plant has the capacity to cause physiological dependence;  (iv) possession or conduct in relation to the substance or plant is proscribed under a law of a State, a Territory or a foreign country that has purposes similar to those of this Part;  (v) the substance or plant poses a substantial risk to the health or safety of the public."@en ;
