concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-1-sec-301-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "301 17  Emergency determinations—publication"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-301-23 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must, on or before the day on which a determination under this Subdivision is registered (within the meaning of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003):  (a) make a public announcement of the determination; and  (b) cause a copy of the announcement to be published:  (i) on the internet; and  (ii) in a newspaper circulating in each State, the Australian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory.  (2) An announcement made under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167  Serious drugs  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012 No. 167, 2012            17" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must, on or before the day on which a determination under this Subdivision is registered (within the meaning of the Legislative Instruments Act 2003):  (a) make a public announcement of the determination; and  (b) cause a copy of the announcement to be published:  (i) on the internet; and  (ii) in a newspaper circulating in each State, the Australian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory.  (2) An announcement made under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167  Serious drugs  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012 No. 167, 2012            17"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "30110ee4030cba6ee7502de629adfb9d57ee00656ef2e59f9f45bbac25a97618" ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-1-sec-301-23-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-1-sec-301-23-ss-2 ;
