concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-3un a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3UN Identity information at airports—offences relating to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-3un ;
    values:originalText "section 3UM Offence by suspect  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) a constable makes a request of the person under subsection 3UM(3); and  (b) the person fails to comply with the request; and  (c) the constable complies with subsection 3UM(4). Penalty: 20 penalty units. Note: The following more serious offences may also apply: (a) giving false or misleading information (see section 137.1 of the Criminal Code); (b) producing a false or misleading document (see section 137.2 of the Criminal Code); (c) obstructing a Commonwealth public official (see section 149.1 of the Criminal Code).  (2) Strict liability applies to paragraphs (1)(a) and (c). Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167  Schedule 2  Identity crime and air travel" ;
    skos:definition "section 3UM Offence by suspect  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) a constable makes a request of the person under subsection 3UM(3); and  (b) the person fails to comply with the request; and  (c) the constable complies with subsection 3UM(4). Penalty: 20 penalty units. Note: The following more serious offences may also apply: (a) giving false or misleading information (see section 137.1 of the Criminal Code); (b) producing a false or misleading document (see section 137.2 of the Criminal Code); (c) obstructing a Commonwealth public official (see section 149.1 of the Criminal Code).  (2) Strict liability applies to paragraphs (1)(a) and (c). Note: For strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167  Schedule 2  Identity crime and air travel"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fa5cf71545e64adb03f76f71cde2d67156789bcc34371506dc9aa8171ca6da21" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-3un-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-3un-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf, p.29" .
