concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "376 1  Definitions for Division 376"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-376 ;
    values:originalText "In this Division: air passenger ticket, for a flight, means a ticket, or electronic record, on the basis of which a person is treated as being entitled to travel as a passenger on:  (a) the flight; or  (b) a journey that includes the flight. false: identification information relating to a person is false if it is false in a material particular that affects the capacity of the information to be used (whether alone or in conjunction with other information or documents) to identify the person. Note: For the meaning of identification information, see section 370.1. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167  Identity crime and air travel  Schedule 2 False identity and air travel  Part 2  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012 No. 167, 2012            27" ;
    skos:definition "In this Division: air passenger ticket, for a flight, means a ticket, or electronic record, on the basis of which a person is treated as being entitled to travel as a passenger on:  (a) the flight; or  (b) a journey that includes the flight. false: identification information relating to a person is false if it is false in a material particular that affects the capacity of the information to be used (whether alone or in conjunction with other information or documents) to identify the person. Note: For the meaning of identification information, see section 370.1. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167  Identity crime and air travel  Schedule 2 False identity and air travel  Part 2  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012 No. 167, 2012            27"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "613c3cb5cd4275a85eeb005cc7b4ade6632c751f9cdd68de060b801672d5b398" ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definition of air passenger ticket and false identification information" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf, p.30" ;
    cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376-norm .
