    cml:operator "Temporal relation" ;
    cml:logicSummary "The prohibition on referring ACLEI corruption issue to Integrity Commissioner for investigation under Division 3 applies only if the issue relates to the conduct of the Integrity Commissioner or an Assistant Integrity Commissioner." ;
