concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-3-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendment made by item 7 of this Schedule applies in relation to an offence committed after the commencement of this item. Note: Subitem (1) mirrors subsection 4F(1) of the Crimes Act 1914. (2) Subsection 4AA(1A) of the Crimes Act 1914, as inserted by this Schedule, applies in relation to the alteration of the amount of a penalty unit made by this Schedule, and future alterations. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167  Other measures  Schedule 3 Superannuation orders  Part 3  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012 No. 167, 2012            35" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendment made by item 7 of this Schedule applies in relation to an offence committed after the commencement of this item. Note: Subitem (1) mirrors subsection 4F(1) of the Crimes Act 1914. (2) Subsection 4AA(1A) of the Crimes Act 1914, as inserted by this Schedule, applies in relation to the alteration of the amount of a penalty unit made by this Schedule, and future alterations. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167  Other measures  Schedule 3 Superannuation orders  Part 3  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012 No. 167, 2012            35"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6bee4d8779d8e68e976a6edb9609d6c0345536f3ae4557dffb3d8f8b234cea2f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of amendments" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
